":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nVW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d443c458-32c6-49c0-bf60-395d35280145","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"就活はいいんですが、ゴールが見えないと辛いという話ですね","ts":"1637759000.432100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WbBY2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0d78c01b-715a-4b33-a19a-026fb8364bb7","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"自分も就活したくなかったけど、社会人になったらなったらで色々経験できてよかったなって思っています","ts":"1637758749.431600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iaxjr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4b366e98-4ec8-4e30-a571-cde218094940","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"周り見てると就活始まってるなあと思い暗澹たる気分になるなど\n去年とか就活してた先輩がメンタルやられてたのを思い出してこういう事かと理解できつつあるのでつらい","ts":"1637757901.430000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xpj"}]}]
